<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cuts Sun Micro.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cuts Sun Micro.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman, Sachs removed Sun Microsystems Inc from its priority list, but maintained the stock on its recommended list, said computer systems analyst Laura Conigliaro.</p>
<p>-- The Goldman analyst said the decision relected a desire to rebalance the priority list by reducing its exposure to the technology sector.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
